  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the sous-vide machine to 130 degrees.",
    "Season the chicken breast with salt and pepper, then seal in a sous-vide bag and cook for 2 hours.",
    "Roast the peppers in the oven at 400 degrees for 30 minutes, then peel and slice.",
    "Warm the corn tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Slice the cooked chicken breast into thin strips.",
    "Assemble the tacos by placing a slice of comte cheese, a few strips of chicken, some roasted peppers, and a sprinkle of cilantro onto a tortilla.",
    "Drizzle the tacos with lime juice and olive oil.",
